    "body": "Removes the error to avoid false positives. We cannot easily distinguish how they were originally declared, and with assignment (noticed) or not (not noticed), so we rather warn in obvious cases and leave it to that.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/7920\r\nError was added in https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7253",
